sequenceDiagram
  participant NET as ConnectivityService
  participant SYNC as SyncService
  participant OFS as OfflineExpenseService
  participant API as Backend API
  NET-->>SYNC: online event
  SYNC->>OFS: getPendingQueue()
  OFS-->>SYNC: operations
  loop each operation
    SYNC->>API: execute request
    API-->>SYNC: response
    SYNC->>OFS: markSynced or keepRetry
  end
  SYNC->>OFS: updateLocalData()
